cv_region_features<- CHcv_region_features[Regions::Features:Values]
short.german
  Berechnet Formmerkmale einer Region (cv_region).;

short.english
  按名称计算 region 的形状特征，对应 HALCON region_features。Features 为特征名元组，口径与 cv_select_shape 完全一致；支持 54 个名称：area/row/column/width/height/ratio/row1/column1/row2/column2/circularity/compactness/convexity/rectangularity/contlength/phi/ra/rb/anisometry/bulkiness/struct_factor（别名 structure_factor）/outer_radius/max_diameter/dist_mean/dist_deviation/roundness/num_sides/orientation/connect_num/holes_num/area_holes/euler_number/rect2_phi/rect2_len1/rect2_len2/moments_m11/moments_m20/moments_m02/moments_ia/moments_ib/moments_m11_invar/moments_m20_invar/moments_m02_invar/moments_phi1/moments_phi2/moments_m21/moments_m12/moments_m03/moments_m30/moments_m21_invar/moments_m12_invar/moments_m03_invar/moments_m30_invar。与 HALCON region_features 实测：27 个特征（ratio、outer_radius、rect2_len1/2、max_diameter、connect_num、holes_num、area_holes、euler_number 与 18 个 moments_*）数值一致（≤1e-13）；其余为已知偏差（phi 系符号相反、roundness 系轮廓口径不同，见 README）。Regions 可为元组，输出 Values 平铺为「区域数 × 特征数」，区域优先，同一区域的各特征值相邻。;

